<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12840" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποκλαίω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπ-κλάω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾱ]</span>, fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κλαύσομαι</span>: aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έκλαυσα</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>weep aloud,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.121
			</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ́,</span> etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. στόνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					695
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τινά</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i>bewail much, mourn deeply for,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				931
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				637
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμαυτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phd.</u>
					117c
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποκλαύσασθαι κακά</span>
			<i>bewail one/s</i> woes, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				1467
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν πενίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					564
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τερπνὸν τὸ λέξαι κἀποκλαύσασθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					563
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, also, <i>cease to wail,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Syr.D.</u>
				6
			</span></i>.</div>
